TYPE Stores
     Num AS STRING * 2      'store number
     Div AS STRING * 1      'division
     Nam AS STRING * 26     'store name
     Add AS STRING * 26     'address
     Str AS STRING * 26     'street
     Cty AS STRING * 17     'city
     Sta AS STRING * 2      'state
     Zip AS STRING * 5      'zip code
     Cod AS STRING * 3      '***************
     AAA AS STRING * 1      'company code
     Tel AS STRING * 12     'voice phone
     BBB AS STRING * 4      '***************
     Pho AS STRING * 12     'data phone
     Opn AS STRING * 10     'openning date
     Man AS STRING * 16     'manager
     Acc AS STRING * 16     'account manager
     Acm AS STRING * 16     'account manager
     Sec AS STRING * 16     'secratery
     Stx AS STRING * 5      'sales tax
     CCC AS STRING * 16     '***************
     END TYPE

